{
  "declaredLength": 2376,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "못 한다니까 그러네!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BABB0020D55CB2E4B2C8AE4C0020ADF8B7ECB12400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐야? 이쪽은 손님이라고!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50C57C003F0020C774CABDC7400020C190B2D8C774B77CACE000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앗! <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!\n미안하지만 나 좀 도와줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5570021002000100002010000000021000ABBF8C548D558C9C0B9CC0020B0980020C8800020B3C4C640C9180021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 사람의 짐을 옮겨 주려고 했는데\n말도 안 되는 주문을 하는 데다<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n포켓몬 승부까지 하자고 하지 뭐야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C0ACB78CC7580020C9D0C7440020C62EACA80020C8FCB824ACE00020D588B294B370000AB9D0B3C40020C5480020B418B2940020C8FCBB38C7440020D558B2940020B370B2E400100001BE00000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80AE4CC9C00020D558C790ACE00020D558C9C00020BB50C57C0021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 소중한 보스로라를 옮겨 달라는데\n못 한다고 하면 내가 화가 안 나!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020C18CC911D55C0020BCF4C2A4B85CB77CB97C0020C62EACA80020B2ECB77CB294B370000ABABB0020D55CB2E4ACE00020D558BA740020B0B4AC000020D654AC000020C5480020B0980021003F001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "몸무게가 360kg이나 되는 보스로라를\n나보고 어떻게 옮기라는 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAB8BB34AC8CAC000020003300360030006B0067C774B0980020B418B2940020BCF4C2A4B85CB77CB97C000AB098BCF4ACE00020C5B4B5BBAC8C0020C62EAE30B77CB2940020AC70C57C0021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시끄러워! 옮기지도 못할 거면서\n함부로 입을 놀린 대가를 치르게 해 주겠어!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n정 뭐하면 둘 다 한꺼번에 덤벼!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCB044B7ECC6CC00210020C62EAE30C9C0B3C40020BABBD5600020AC70BA74C11C000AD568BD80B85C0020C785C7440020B180B9B00020B300AC00B97C0020CE58B974AC8C0020D5740020C8FCACA0C5B4002100100001BE00000AC8150020BB50D558BA740020B4580020B2E40020D55CAEBCBC88C5D00020B364BCBC0021001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 미르시티에 온 이유는\nZA로열에 도전하기 위해!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n너희같이 비실해 보이는 트레이너 둘도\n동시에 이기지 못하면 참가할 자격도 없지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "말이 안 통하는 사람이라는 건 알겠지?\n알았으면 나랑 같이 싸워 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9D0C7740020C5480020D1B5D558B2940020C0ACB78CC774B77CB2940020AC740020C54CACA0C9C0003F000AC54CC558C73CBA740020B098B7910020AC19C7740020C2F8C6CC0020C9180021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나랑 같이 싸워 줄 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B7910020AC19C7740020C2F8C6CC0020C9040020AC70C57C003F001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "싸워 줄게",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2F8C6CC0020C904AC8C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠깐만",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0AE50B9CC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "...언제까지 기다리게 할 셈이야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002EC5B8C81CAE4CC9C00020AE30B2E4B9ACAC8C0020D5600020C148C774C57C003F001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리가 만나게 된 거 말이야.\n판짱이 네 가방을 가져와서였지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACAC000020B9CCB098AC8C0020B41C0020AC700020B9D0C774C57C002E000AD310C9F1C7740020B1240020AC00BC29C7440020AC00C838C640C11CC600C9C0003F001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그땐 미안했어.\n지금은 잘 부탁해!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B5500020BBF8C548D588C5B4002E000AC9C0AE08C7400020C7980020BD80D0C1D5740021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 몸의 보스로라와 포켓몬들이\n너희를 날려 버려 줄 거다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020BAB8C7580020BCF4C2A4B85CB77CC6400020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C774000AB108D76CB97C0020B0A0B8240020BC84B8240020C9040020AC70B2E40021001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티 트레이너의 수준이\n이렇게나 높을 줄이야...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F00020D2B8B808C774B108C7580020C218C900C774000AC774B807AC8CB0980020B192C7440020C904C774C57C002E002E002E001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZA로열 참가는 포기하겠어!\n관광이나 하다 돌아가야지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƎ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041B85CC5F40020CC38AC00B2940020D3ECAE30D558ACA0C5B40021000AAD00AD11C774B0980020D558B2E40020B3CCC544AC00C57CC9C00021001000020114018E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보스로라를 옮겨 달라고\n고집부리지만 않았어도 안내해 줬을 텐데.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4C2A4B85CB77CB97C0020C62EACA80020B2ECB77CACE0000AACE0C9D1BD80B9ACC9C0B9CC0020C54AC558C5B4B3C40020C548B0B4D5740020C92CC7440020D150B370002E001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "판짱!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D310C9F100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "덕분에 살았어, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n가방 일도 있었는데\n도와줘서 고마워.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B355BD84C5D00020C0B4C558C5B4002C00200010000201000000002E00100001BE01000AAC00BC290020C77CB3C40020C788C5C8B294B370000AB3C4C640C918C11C0020ACE0B9C8C6CC002E001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "판짱이 여행 가방을 옮기는 모습을\n보고 나서 말이야...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D310C9F1C7740020C5ECD5890020AC00BC29C7440020C62EAE30B2940020BAA8C2B5C744000ABCF4ACE00020B098C11C0020B9D0C774C57C002E002E002E001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "판짱이 관광객들의 짐을 옮겨 주는 동안\n나는 미르시티를 안내하는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n비즈니스를 시작하게 됐어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D310C9F1C7740020AD00AD11AC1DB4E4C7580020C9D0C7440020C62EACA80020C8FCB2940020B3D9C548000AB098B2940020BBF8B974C2DCD2F0B97C0020C548B0B4D558B29400100001BE00000ABE44C988B2C8C2A4B97C0020C2DCC791D558AC8C0020B410C5B4002E001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬은 담장 위같이\n사람이 갈 수 없는 곳도 다닐 수 있잖아.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAACC7400020B2F4C7A50020C704AC19C774000AC0ACB78CC7740020AC080020C2180020C5C6B2940020ACF3B3C40020B2E4B2D00020C2180020C788C796C544002E001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "약속 시간에서 꽤 지났는데, 괜찮은 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ-",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57DC18D0020C2DCAC04C5D0C11C0020AF640020C9C0B0ACB294B370002C0020AD1CCC2EC7400020AC70C57C003F001000020114002D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앙드레?\n응, 괜찮아.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C559B4DCB808003F000AC751002C0020AD1CCC2EC544002E001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트러블이 있긴 했는데\n무사히 해결했으니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n이제 그쪽으로 갈게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B7ECBE14C7740020C788AE340020D588B294B370000ABB34C0ACD7880020D574ACB0D588C73CB2C8AE4C00100001BE00000AC774C81C0020ADF8CABDC73CB85C0020AC08AC8C0021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZA로열에서 크게 활약하고 있다며?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그런 네가 미르시티에서\n처음 배틀한 상대가 나라니, 괜히 뿌듯한걸?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041B85CC5F4C5D0C11C0020D06CAC8C0020D65CC57DD558ACE00020C788B2E4BA70003F00100001BE01000AADF8B7F00020B124AC000020BBF8B974C2DCD2F0C5D0C11C000ACC98C74C0020BC30D2C0D55C0020C0C1B300AC000020B098B77CB2C8002C0020AD1CD7880020BFCCB4EFD55CAC78003F001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 나는 이만 가 볼게.\n다음에 또 보자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020B098B2940020C774B9CC0020AC000020BCFCAC8C002E000AB2E4C74CC5D00020B6100020BCF4C7900021001000020114002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    }
  ],
